{
  "@id": "dtmi:advantech:EdgeSync:SystemAgent:SystemResource;1",
  "@type": "Interface",
  "@context": "dtmi:dtdl:context;2",
  "displayName": "System Agent \u2014 System Resource Telemetry",
  "description": "Config-only DTDL v2 schema for the SystemResource MetricTypes (cpu, memory, disk, network, system). contents[] is empty by design -- describes the devicecfg.json Sensor surface, not a telemetry contract. schemas[] publishes reusable Enums and typed Parameters Objects (CpuSensorParameters, MemorySensorParameters, DiskSensorParameters, NetworkSensorParameters, SystemSensorParameters) consumed by config-rules.js.",
